Solution:Here is a possible implementation of such a template:
```cpp
template <typename T, size_t N>
struct ArrayOffset {
    static constexpr size_t value = offsetof(T, elements[N - 1]);
};
```
This template can be used as follows:
```cpp
int main() {
    int arr[5] = {1, 2, 3, 4, 5};
    std::cout << "Offset of last element in array: "
              << ArrayOffset<int, 5>::value << std::endl;
    return 0;
}
```
